[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5939759397","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123972#issuecomment-5939759397","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123972","id":5939759397,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYgmJJQ","user":{"login":"realybin","id":172874642,"node_id":"U_kgDOCk3bkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172874642?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin","html_url":"https://github.com/realybin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T20:17:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T20:48:06Z","body":"Reproduced on my device.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/12c17c187e88efa23e6bbd6689630e256eca6523/editor/script/script_editor_plugin.cpp#L1985-L2005\n\nI tried debugging it and found that `set_current_path` is never triggered. Because `get_edited_resource` returned a `GDScript`, `Ref<TextFile> text_file` ends up empty. So `text_file.is_valid()` returns false, and `set_current_path` is never called in this case.\n\n<img width=\"2115\" height=\"1620\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8cf91ff7-782f-4319-af5d-f62c2f579e6e\" />\n\nThen we call `EditorNode::get_singleton()->save_resource_as(resource)`, but no `p_at_path` is provided, so the *\"Suggest the selected script name: new_script.gd\"* never shows up.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/12c17c187e88efa23e6bbd6689630e256eca6523/editor/script/script_editor_plugin.cpp#L2007-L2015\n\nAnd since we're reusing the same dialog instance, the filename field is preserved by `SCENE_SAVE_AS_SCENE`.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/12c17c187e88efa23e6bbd6689630e256eca6523/editor/editor_node.cpp#L3615-L3618\n\nAs a result, the dialog shows the last *Save As* scene name instead.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/12c17c187e88efa23e6bbd6689630e256eca6523/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1920-L1942\n\nSince I don't have much experience with large projects, I'm not sure how to fix this. Hope this investigation helps — happy to assist with any follow-up.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5939759397/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5951636490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123972#issuecomment-5951636490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123972","id":5951636490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYr7ECg","user":{"login":"realybin","id":172874642,"node_id":"U_kgDOCk3bkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172874642?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin","html_url":"https://github.com/realybin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-02T11:43:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T11:43:44Z","body":"This could also happen when saving any other already-saved resource, not just GDScript.\n\n<img width=\"1797\" height=\"943\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1248e2c5-7849-4ee5-8b94-3234c5fbb041\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5951636490/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5954019387","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123972#issuecomment-5954019387","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123972","id":5954019387,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYuMgOw","user":{"login":"realybin","id":172874642,"node_id":"U_kgDOCk3bkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172874642?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin","html_url":"https://github.com/realybin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/use